# ---- Scope: the repo tracks the 2023-2024 cohort only ----------------------
# Earlier cohorts and the thesis stay on disk; the directory structure is
# unchanged. They are excluded so a release archive contains only what
# reproduces this paper.
results/2020-2021/
tex/thesis/

# ---- LaTeX build artifacts -------------------------------------------------
# Regenerated by every compile. main.bbl is deliberately NOT ignored: Wiley
# asks for it alongside the .tex at submission.
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.blg
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.pag
*.fff
*.ttt
*-eps-converted-to.pdf
